# Pins the local runner image act uses, so `act` runs are reproducible.
# catthehacker/ubuntu is a community-maintained image that approximates the real
# (much larger) GitHub-hosted ubuntu-latest runner more closely than plain `ubuntu`.
# See project-meta/docs/tooling.md for act + Docker/Podman/Apptainer notes.
-P ubuntu-latest=catthehacker/ubuntu:act-latest
